(4619764, 666236, 91451, '<td valign="top">The post processing on the edge of the bottom hand could have been a bit smoother, but I think this is a pretty good photo overall.</td>', 'The post processing on the edge of the bottom hand could have been a bit smoother, but I think this is a pretty good photo overall.', '2008-04-07 01:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4619766, 666426, 47316, '<td valign="top">While this is touching subject matter and a brave model who has posed for this I feel the photo doesn''t quite hit the nail on the head... if that makes sense. There is no emotion conveyed because she is "sleeping". I think this subject would be best served as a portrait, and just that. No theme necessary.</td>', 'While this is touching subject matter and a brave model who has posed for this I feel the photo doesn''t quite hit the nail on the head... if that makes sense. There is no emotion conveyed because she is "sleeping". I think this subject would be best served as a portrait, and just that. No theme necessary.', '2008-04-07 01:24:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4619770, 666506, 47316, '<td valign="top">creepy. I''m assuming you will get a lot of DNMCs since you are not focusing on a body part. Other than that I think it was a success in that it caught my attention and is creepy but I think more dramatic lighting would have helped a lot.</td>', 'creepy. I''m assuming you will get a lot of DNMCs since you are not focusing on a body part. Other than that I think it was a success in that it caught my attention and is creepy but I think more dramatic lighting would have helped a lot.', '2008-04-07 01:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4619782, 666046, 47316, '<td valign="top">wow. very subtle image. I like the tones and textures. I''m having trouble with a critique because I do find the flowers to be distracting and more the main subject; but if you were to take them away the image wouldn''t stand on it''s own. Perhaps a more simple accessory would have done the trick. Like a sash...</td>', 'wow. very subtle image. I like the tones and textures. I''m having trouble with a critique because I do find the flowers to be distracting and more the main subject; but if you were to take them away the image wouldn''t stand on it''s own. Perhaps a more simple accessory would have done the trick. Like a sash...', '2008-04-07 01:28:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4619794, 665739, 34938, '<td valign="top">gorgeous eyes...great capture</td>', 'gorgeous eyes...great capture', '2008-04-07 01:30:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4619796, 666419, 46177, '<td valign="top">Stunning image, I love the soft whites against the white background and the way the eye is peeking over the arm.</td>', 'Stunning image, I love the soft whites against the white background and the way the eye is peeking over the arm.', '2008-04-07 01:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4619800, 666439, 47316, '<td valign="top">reminds me of sculptures... the ones where a lot is going on and you can''t tell where one person ends and the other begins. Sweet image but I am having trouble feeling a sense of composition.</td>', 'reminds me of sculptures... the ones where a lot is going on and you can''t tell where one person ends and the other begins. Sweet image but I am having trouble feeling a sense of composition.', '2008-04-07 01:31:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4619807, 666085, 47316, '<td valign="top">strange contradictory image. I actually thought the cloth was a knife blade in the thumbnail. But even now that I know what it is the editing and the dark colors make me think anything but dainty.</td>', 'strange contradictory image. I actually thought the cloth was a knife blade in the thumbnail. But even now that I know what it is the editing and the dark colors make me think anything but dainty.', '2008-04-07 01:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4619823, 666419, 47316, '<td valign="top">wow. I don''t know how I missed this on my first sweep of the thumbnails. Very well done! Lovely shapes and the contrast of the dark eye with the high key image is perfect. I have a small monitor so I can''t the whole image at one time and have to scroll and I actually think each half of the image could almost work on its own but is wonderful all together.</td>', 'wow. I don''t know how I missed this on my first sweep of the thumbnails. Very well done! Lovely shapes and the contrast of the dark eye with the high key image is perfect. I have a small monitor so I can''t the whole image at one time and have to scroll and I actually think each half of the image could almost work on its own but is wonderful all together.', '2008-04-07 01:36:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4619825, 665388, 24976, '<td valign="top">really cool! ring flash? would have been better imo if the dof was a bit wider so the nose was in focus too. 8</td>', 'really cool! ring flash? would have been better imo if the dof was a bit wider so the nose was in focus too. 8', '2008-04-07 01:36:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4619832, 666500, 46778, '<td valign="top">Nice close up. The only thought is that I find it a little soft focus, especially on such a tight shoot. Trying to figure out what the reflection is in the center :) -6-</td>', 'Nice close up. The only thought is that I find it a little soft focus, especially on such a tight shoot. Trying to figure out what the reflection is in the center :) -6-', '2008-04-07 01:37:56.000000', NULL, 1),
