(4619834, 666169, 24976, '<td valign="top">very nice eye (color, sharpness, etc) but the out of focus mildly blown out finger is a huge minus though...</td>', 'very nice eye (color, sharpness, etc) but the out of focus mildly blown out finger is a huge minus though...', '2008-04-07 01:38:10.000000', NULL, 1),
