(4619880, 666183, 46778, '<td valign="top">I like the BW conversion as well as the "message". Not sure if would have used the ring? The blurred background is nice as well. Maybe a more DOF to get all of the hands in clear would be nice, but that is a personal preference. -7-</td>', 'I like the BW conversion as well as the "message". Not sure if would have used the ring? The blurred background is nice as well. Maybe a more DOF to get all of the hands in clear would be nice, but that is a personal preference. -7-', '2008-04-07 01:49:56.000000', NULL, 1),
