(4620072, 664372, 68035, '<td valign="top">Yes!!!  I really like this shot and the rotation takes it beyong being just another body part far into the work of abstract art.  I like the b&amp;w conversion although the noise does detract slightly in my opinion.  Still a lovely image and 8 from me</td>', 'Yes!!!  I really like this shot and the rotation takes it beyong being just another body part far into the work of abstract art.  I like the b&w conversion although the noise does detract slightly in my opinion.  Still a lovely image and 8 from me', '2008-04-07 03:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4620073, 666435, 53147, '<td valign="top">Strong minimalism. So simple and light that its almost relaxing sitting here looking at it. At first I thought it was a charliebaker image because all I could see was a white screen before pulling down (which would normally really irritate me) but after pulling down a smile came to my face. Very cool shot.</td>', 'Strong minimalism. So simple and light that its almost relaxing sitting here looking at it. At first I thought it was a charliebaker image because all I could see was a white screen before pulling down (which would normally really irritate me) but after pulling down a smile came to my face. Very cool shot.', '2008-04-07 03:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4620075, 666344, 68035, '<td valign="top">Super shot and great sharpness.  The reflection of the thumb on the white keys adds another dimension<br/> <br/>great image</td>', 'Super shot and great sharpness.  The reflection of the thumb on the white keys adds another dimension great image', '2008-04-07 03:43:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4620077, 665799, 53147, '<td valign="top">Really good idea and layout. I so wish it was clean and noise free. Also looking at it a bit longer I wish that all of the right hands were on top all the way around, that they were all gripping the same way to make the circle flow uniformly. the 2,4 and 6 oclock hands throw off the rhythm some (though arranging bodies I am sure wasnt the easiest).</td>', 'Really good idea and layout. I so wish it was clean and noise free. Also looking at it a bit longer I wish that all of the right hands were on top all the way around, that they were all gripping the same way to make the circle flow uniformly. the 2,4 and 6 oclock hands throw off the rhythm some (though arranging bodies I am sure wasnt the easiest).', '2008-04-07 03:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4620080, 665864, 53147, '<td valign="top">Great use of a window. I  like the effect you achieved with this. After challenge if you could tell me what kind of glass it is I would appreciate it. Gives me ideas.</td>', 'Great use of a window. I  like the effect you achieved with this. After challenge if you could tell me what kind of glass it is I would appreciate it. Gives me ideas.', '2008-04-07 03:48:02.000000', NULL, 1),
