(4620530, 666483, 30049, '<td valign="top">Ok.  Here''s an "artistic" photo that many have been belaboring doesn''t exist or get enough recognition on DPC.  This is a wonderful (if not sadly true) story being told in a powerful, eye-catching way.  Strong message, and technicals to match!<br/> <br/>This image is deserving of all the praise it receives and then some.  I hope you take this photo to many places and gather acclaims around the world.  Worthy of display in many galleries!<br/> <br/>Congratulations, and Thanks for this vision!</td>', 'Ok.  Here''s an "artistic" photo that many have been belaboring doesn''t exist or get enough recognition on DPC.  This is a wonderful (if not sadly true) story being told in a powerful, eye-catching way.  Strong message, and technicals to match! This image is deserving of all the praise it receives and then some.  I hope you take this photo to many places and gather acclaims around the world.  Worthy of display in many galleries! Congratulations, and Thanks for this vision!', '2008-04-07 10:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4620532, 666538, 30049, '<td valign="top">A little over the top with noise reduction it appears.  Fun composition.</td>', 'A little over the top with noise reduction it appears.  Fun composition.', '2008-04-07 10:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4620533, 666046, 15711, '<td valign="top">The flowery fabric is so distracting from the back.  I love the shot though. Nice lighting - I''d just crop out most of the bottom area.</td>', 'The flowery fabric is so distracting from the back.  I love the shot though. Nice lighting - I''d just crop out most of the bottom area.', '2008-04-07 10:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
