(4620747, 666049, 47316, '<td valign="top">I think this might have worked better if he had a more lighthearted expression. Here it looks like he''s just concentrating really hard or something (which might have been the case?). It''s a cute idea and the dof is nice. On my monitor his skin tone looks a little purple on his face.</td>', 'I think this might have worked better if he had a more lighthearted expression. Here it looks like he''s just concentrating really hard or something (which might have been the case?). It''s a cute idea and the dof is nice. On my monitor his skin tone looks a little purple on his face.', '2008-04-07 11:25:49.000000', NULL, 1);
