(4620893, 666234, 2764, '<td valign="top">Oh dear, another one, and I like this one much better.  I hope your friend isn''t insulted if I give this a better score.  Makes me laugh!</td>', 'Oh dear, another one, and I like this one much better.  I hope your friend isn''t insulted if I give this a better score.  Makes me laugh!', '2008-04-07 12:45:19.000000', NULL, 1),
