(4621624, 665416, 2134, '<td valign="top">Great shot....</td>', 'Great shot....', '2008-04-07 17:46:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4621628, 666438, 2134, '<td valign="top">Looks like a shot that was just hurried to enter the challenge... sorry</td>', 'Looks like a shot that was just hurried to enter the challenge... sorry', '2008-04-07 17:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4621629, 666331, 2134, '<td valign="top">Great eyes... nice portrait</td>', 'Great eyes... nice portrait', '2008-04-07 17:48:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4621631, 664372, 2134, '<td valign="top">OOF and just not a very good photo. IMO</td>', 'OOF and just not a very good photo. IMO', '2008-04-07 17:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4621635, 666321, 2134, '<td valign="top">DNMC  in my opinion... sorry</td>', 'DNMC  in my opinion... sorry', '2008-04-07 17:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4621638, 666419, 2134, '<td valign="top">Beautiful... I like everything about this photo.</td>', 'Beautiful... I like everything about this photo.', '2008-04-07 17:53:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4621645, 666488, 2134, '<td valign="top">What a great capture...</td>', 'What a great capture...', '2008-04-07 17:55:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4621649, 666518, 2134, '<td valign="top">Too OOF...</td>', 'Too OOF...', '2008-04-07 17:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4621652, 666347, 2134, '<td valign="top">Too much emphasis on the trees and not on your subject.</td>', 'Too much emphasis on the trees and not on your subject.', '2008-04-07 17:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4621716, 666431, 47274, '<td valign="top">haha this took me a while</td>', 'haha this took me a while', '2008-04-07 18:34:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4621745, 666085, 43774, '<td valign="top">You may not like what I have to say. Yes, it''s a hand so it meets the challenge. Personally I do not like images that are overprocessed, especially images of hands that are overprocessed making them look old, wrinkled and dirty. Your focus seems a bit soft here. Your title does not go with the photo. You say dainty but it is a dirty looking hand with a dirty handkerchief.<br/> <br/>That being said, I think there are good points to the photo. The composition is good as is the black background. If you had toned down the processing some and had a frilly or lace hankie I think it would look a lot better.</td>', 'You may not like what I have to say. Yes, it''s a hand so it meets the challenge. Personally I do not like images that are overprocessed, especially images of hands that are overprocessed making them look old, wrinkled and dirty. Your focus seems a bit soft here. Your title does not go with the photo. You say dainty but it is a dirty looking hand with a dirty handkerchief. That being said, I think there are good points to the photo. The composition is good as is the black background. If you had toned down the processing some and had a frilly or lace hankie I think it would look a lot better.', '2008-04-07 18:48:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4621797, 666264, 45475, '<td valign="top">I''m not quite sure how to critique this. It certainly meets the challenge, but a combination of harsh light and distracting specks makes it slightly unappealing. The focus on the eye is good, maybe try placing the key light lower?</td>', 'I''m not quite sure how to critique this. It certainly meets the challenge, but a combination of harsh light and distracting specks makes it slightly unappealing. The focus on the eye is good, maybe try placing the key light lower?', '2008-04-07 19:19:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4621801, 666431, 45475, '<td valign="top">Very naughty :)</td>', 'Very naughty :)', '2008-04-07 19:22:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4621813, 666051, 45475, '<td valign="top">I can''t quite tell if it''s motion blur or just slightly out of focus. I think it might be the former. I guess my advice would be to try this again in an area with loads more light so you can bump up the shutter speed. I really like this, just a shame about the blur.</td>', 'I can''t quite tell if it''s motion blur or just slightly out of focus. I think it might be the former. I guess my advice would be to try this again in an area with loads more light so you can bump up the shutter speed. I really like this, just a shame about the blur.', '2008-04-07 19:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4621818, 666334, 45475, '<td valign="top">Very good focus, but the angle/point of view wasn''t the best idea here, it''s too close. Maybe pull back a little and keep level with the subject, rather than an upward perspective? The flash has also caused hot areas on the cheek. Again, you''d either have to pull back or turn the flash down if possible. Good effort though :)</td>', 'Very good focus, but the angle/point of view wasn''t the best idea here, it''s too close. Maybe pull back a little and keep level with the subject, rather than an upward perspective? The flash has also caused hot areas on the cheek. Again, you''d either have to pull back or turn the flash down if possible. Good effort though :)', '2008-04-07 19:38:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4621823, 666447, 45475, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but the lighting could have been better to bring out more of the lines and texture in the skin.</td>', 'Good idea, but the lighting could have been better to bring out more of the lines and texture in the skin.', '2008-04-07 19:43:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4621830, 666399, 45475, '<td valign="top">Wow, a fairly confronting look at aging. Although not a hugely appealing image, great job on accentuating all those lines. The editing though has left a strange fuzzy halo along all the edges.</td>', 'Wow, a fairly confronting look at aging. Although not a hugely appealing image, great job on accentuating all those lines. The editing though has left a strange fuzzy halo along all the edges.', '2008-04-07 19:49:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4621831, 666066, 45475, '<td valign="top">Excellent selective desat, but the greys are a bit flat leaving the skin looking pasty.</td>', 'Excellent selective desat, but the greys are a bit flat leaving the skin looking pasty.', '2008-04-07 19:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4621833, 666371, 15407, '<td valign="top">I can''t figgure it our +1 for that!</td>', 'I can''t figgure it our +1 for that!', '2008-04-07 19:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4621837, 666419, 15407, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lines and curves and an eye to the soul</td>', 'Beautiful lines and curves and an eye to the soul', '2008-04-07 19:57:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4621838, 666363, 45475, '<td valign="top">Not sure what to make of this. The lighting is okay, but a little boost in contrast/curves (no pun intended) would have made the whites whiter. I''d suggest using a healing tool of some sort, to clean up some minor imperfections in the skin as well the sensor dust visible under her arm. The pose feels a little awkward too.</td>', 'Not sure what to make of this. The lighting is okay, but a little boost in contrast/curves (no pun intended) would have made the whites whiter. I''d suggest using a healing tool of some sort, to clean up some minor imperfections in the skin as well the sensor dust visible under her arm. The pose feels a little awkward too.', '2008-04-07 19:57:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4621842, 666534, 45475, '<td valign="top">Fun idea! The problem I have with it though is the orange skin tone and the uneven make-up application.</td>', 'Fun idea! The problem I have with it though is the orange skin tone and the uneven make-up application.', '2008-04-07 20:07:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4621850, 666316, 45475, '<td valign="top">Great focus and interesting choice of body part. The level of light looks good, but what''s bringing it down is the yellow/orange cast through it. Might be a matter of changing white balance or editing levels or hue&amp;sat?</td>', 'Great focus and interesting choice of body part. The level of light looks good, but what''s bringing it down is the yellow/orange cast through it. Might be a matter of changing white balance or editing levels or hue&sat?', '2008-04-07 20:15:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4621853, 666120, 7778, '<td valign="top">Energy/Range/Story: 8/7/7 <br/>Composition/perspective/manner: 5/5/6 <br/>Aesthetics/Technical:6/6 <br/>Presentation: 6 <br/>Total:6.2 <br/>Vote: 6 <br/> <br/>Remarks: a <i>genuine</i> candid! I like the light mood and the inclusion of the spectators, especially the contorting figure on the extreme right. I can''t tell, if the title is a private reference or not. If it is, I''d consider either a more universal one or a real <i>doozie</i>. A perfect piece of journalism and worth a ribbon, in my book.</td>', 'Energy/Range/Story: 8/7/7 Composition/perspective/manner: 5/5/6 Aesthetics/Technical:6/6 Presentation: 6 Total:6.2 Vote: 6  Remarks: a genuine candid! I like the light mood and the inclusion of the spectators, especially the contorting figure on the extreme right. I can''t tell, if the title is a private reference or not. If it is, I''d consider either a more universal one or a real doozie. A perfect piece of journalism and worth a ribbon, in my book.', '2008-04-07 20:17:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4621855, 666538, 45475, '<td valign="top">Fun entry, but it suffers a fair bit from motion blur. You''ve lost some texture in the skin too and it almost looks like paper mache. Suggestion; try again with more light and a higher shutter speed :)</td>', 'Fun entry, but it suffers a fair bit from motion blur. You''ve lost some texture in the skin too and it almost looks like paper mache. Suggestion; try again with more light and a higher shutter speed :)', '2008-04-07 20:19:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4621856, 666050, 45475, '<td valign="top">Love the soft focus, but the mid tones take over. Maybe push the contrast a bit for some deeper shadows and brighter highlights? Very nice submission to the challenge though.</td>', 'Love the soft focus, but the mid tones take over. Maybe push the contrast a bit for some deeper shadows and brighter highlights? Very nice submission to the challenge though.', '2008-04-07 20:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4621859, 666511, 45475, '<td valign="top">Good grief! :D Fun crop, looks good alongside the toothy poster in the background.</td>', 'Good grief! :D Fun crop, looks good alongside the toothy poster in the background.', '2008-04-07 20:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4621897, 666506, 90495, '<td valign="top">Aww you forgot to include the body parts. ;\</td>', 'Aww you forgot to include the body parts. ;\', '2008-04-07 20:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4621904, 666431, 90495, '<td valign="top">eheh you got me.</td>', 'eheh you got me.', '2008-04-07 20:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
