(4623440, 666330, 33769, '<td valign="top">beautiful choice- i like how you used the light to accentuate the curves of the foot/feet  the black of the tattoo is eye-catching and i like the shapes you created wih the shadows (triangles) and curves (tattoo) and how they go with the overall shape and pose of the feet- nicely done :) I do wish it was a little sharper but I know that is difficult to do in high-key, I gave you a high score :) its one of the ones I really like in this challenge :)</td>', 'beautiful choice- i like how you used the light to accentuate the curves of the foot/feet  the black of the tattoo is eye-catching and i like the shapes you created wih the shadows (triangles) and curves (tattoo) and how they go with the overall shape and pose of the feet- nicely done :) I do wish it was a little sharper but I know that is difficult to do in high-key, I gave you a high score :) its one of the ones I really like in this challenge :)', '2008-04-08 10:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4623446, 666434, 33769, '<td valign="top">beautiful textures; I love how you captured the roughness of the skin and the softness of the skin, its a beautiful contrast well captured :)</td>', 'beautiful textures; I love how you captured the roughness of the skin and the softness of the skin, its a beautiful contrast well captured :)', '2008-04-08 10:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
