(4623498, 665799, 33769, '<td valign="top">beautiful composition, the rings do two things for me, they identify the females in the image, and do slightly distract me from the overall shapes because suddenly i find myself looking hand to hand to see if every other one is wearing rings or not...? I scored this one at an 8 - (would have done a 9 if there was a border?  i think framing this image  in would help with my eyes not drifting out of the frame when i''m gazing over it... its very -beautiful- and I really like it a lot - very difficult to get a lot of people to hold hands and stay still under direcdtion, and I respect that you were able to do that- I hope this image does well :)</td>', 'beautiful composition, the rings do two things for me, they identify the females in the image, and do slightly distract me from the overall shapes because suddenly i find myself looking hand to hand to see if every other one is wearing rings or not...? I scored this one at an 8 - (would have done a 9 if there was a border?  i think framing this image  in would help with my eyes not drifting out of the frame when i''m gazing over it... its very -beautiful- and I really like it a lot - very difficult to get a lot of people to hold hands and stay still under direcdtion, and I respect that you were able to do that- I hope this image does well :)', '2008-04-08 10:43:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4623508, 666007, 73235, '<td valign="top">the light is a tad too harsh for my taste. What it did well, is darkening the background very well.</td>', 'the light is a tad too harsh for my taste. What it did well, is darkening the background very well.', '2008-04-08 10:44:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4623525, 666513, 33769, '<td valign="top">I like how you captured the -red- in the ''mad gleaming eyes'' (i wouldn''t want to make this subject mad :) -very effective use of blue in the image to keep ones eyes on the face/eyes and expression, I think you made a good choice in not using a border on this image, and overall the capture to me-is a very nice one (9)</td>', 'I like how you captured the -red- in the ''mad gleaming eyes'' (i wouldn''t want to make this subject mad :) -very effective use of blue in the image to keep ones eyes on the face/eyes and expression, I think you made a good choice in not using a border on this image, and overall the capture to me-is a very nice one (9)', '2008-04-08 10:45:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4623526, 666307, 73235, '<td valign="top">great capture of this intimate moment. 10</td>', 'great capture of this intimate moment. 10', '2008-04-08 10:45:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4623544, 666463, 33769, '<td valign="top">beautiful details in the hand, and lines-  I do wish more of the palm was in focus-but reading palms i know involves fingers and lines in the fingertips too...  and i know one can''t get that kind of detail with -everything- in focus unless its all ''flat'' and then there wouldn''t be this exciting dynamic of the fingertips slightly curved that is almost...reluctant to be put down (in my opinion) the background is a little distracting to me though I can see that it does add to the composition because of the curve of white and black... (8)</td>', 'beautiful details in the hand, and lines-  I do wish more of the palm was in focus-but reading palms i know involves fingers and lines in the fingertips too...  and i know one can''t get that kind of detail with -everything- in focus unless its all ''flat'' and then there wouldn''t be this exciting dynamic of the fingertips slightly curved that is almost...reluctant to be put down (in my opinion) the background is a little distracting to me though I can see that it does add to the composition because of the curve of white and black... (8)', '2008-04-08 10:48:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4623562, 666488, 33769, '<td valign="top">I love the humor in this image- and the shapes; the details of the hair growing in and the crop- it just shows creativity and an otuside of the box-way of thinking witht he title/action in the image- the balance and expression are great too! -beautiful skin-tones -- (10)</td>', 'I love the humor in this image- and the shapes; the details of the hair growing in and the crop- it just shows creativity and an otuside of the box-way of thinking witht he title/action in the image- the balance and expression are great too! -beautiful skin-tones -- (10)', '2008-04-08 10:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4623596, 666354, 33769, '<td valign="top">nicely done- tasteful and detailed, the textures are graceful and the shadows and shapes are lovely- I voted this one as a 10 (not because its a breast shot, but because it is extremely well composed, the tones of grey and white and black are beautiful and  the details captured are beautiful</td>', 'nicely done- tasteful and detailed, the textures are graceful and the shadows and shapes are lovely- I voted this one as a 10 (not because its a breast shot, but because it is extremely well composed, the tones of grey and white and black are beautiful and  the details captured are beautiful', '2008-04-08 10:56:03.000000', NULL, 1),
