(4623615, 666303, 33769, '<td valign="top">this is a graceful beautiful image; i find it magical with the youthful skin against lace, and soft and pretty with the touch of color on black and white...   this is one of my top choices - i love that you chose to use -half- a face i''m sure her whole face is beautiful, but it somehow adds to the beauty of the image to only see ''half'' - the serene expression of the model is beautiful, and the overall textures are well captured! :)  (~10~)</td>', 'this is a graceful beautiful image; i find it magical with the youthful skin against lace, and soft and pretty with the touch of color on black and white...   this is one of my top choices - i love that you chose to use -half- a face i''m sure her whole face is beautiful, but it somehow adds to the beauty of the image to only see ''half'' - the serene expression of the model is beautiful, and the overall textures are well captured! :)  (~10~)', '2008-04-08 11:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
