(4628473, 666330, 64090, '<td valign="top">I love it. Just the right amount of contrast in my eyes. I like the focus on the toes and not the tattoo, but enough of the tattoo that I''m not just stuck on the toes. I want a copy.</td>', 'I love it. Just the right amount of contrast in my eyes. I like the focus on the toes and not the tattoo, but enough of the tattoo that I''m not just stuck on the toes. I want a copy.', '2008-04-09 21:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
