(4628489, 664446, 64090, '<td valign="top">Maybe just saturate the color in the eye a little more to make it pop a little more. But I do like the hair and the water and the rest of the composition.</td>', 'Maybe just saturate the color in the eye a little more to make it pop a little more. But I do like the hair and the water and the rest of the composition.', '2008-04-09 21:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
