(4628495, 665023, 64090, '<td valign="top">I''m not picking up what the subject is or what it has to do with the challenge. Sorry.</td>', 'I''m not picking up what the subject is or what it has to do with the challenge. Sorry.', '2008-04-09 21:22:32.000000', NULL, 1),
