(4628918, 666523, 57378, '<td valign="top">Nice image - Maybe better in B/W as the pinkyness of the hands I find a little distracting?</td>', 'Nice image - Maybe better in B/W as the pinkyness of the hands I find a little distracting?', '2008-04-09 23:47:50.000000', NULL, 1),
