(4629678, 666532, 58457, '<td valign="top">I really like your photograph.  I don''t think others will have it as highly rated as I do, but I teach art at a high school so this is an image I can certainly connect with.  I like that the focus is right at the tips of the fingers and where the brush meets the paper.  My colleague teaches cartooning and animation and he, too liked your photo.</td>', 'I really like your photograph.  I don''t think others will have it as highly rated as I do, but I teach art at a high school so this is an image I can certainly connect with.  I like that the focus is right at the tips of the fingers and where the brush meets the paper.  My colleague teaches cartooning and animation and he, too liked your photo.', '2008-04-10 10:05:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4629683, 665416, 58457, '<td valign="top">you really get a lot out of this despite having cropped off the upper part of your subject''s face.  The lighting is great, the lipstick is ridiculously red, and the next seems to go on for miles.  Nice work.</td>', 'you really get a lot out of this despite having cropped off the upper part of your subject''s face.  The lighting is great, the lipstick is ridiculously red, and the next seems to go on for miles.  Nice work.', '2008-04-10 10:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4629686, 666141, 58457, '<td valign="top">definitely a creative take on this challenge. your setup and execution is all well done.  I''d like to see your outtakes to see exactly how you did this.</td>', 'definitely a creative take on this challenge. your setup and execution is all well done.  I''d like to see your outtakes to see exactly how you did this.', '2008-04-10 10:07:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4629705, 666488, 58457, '<td valign="top">nice lighting to be able to see the egg so crisply against the white background.  Also a good sense of humor in this picture.</td>', 'nice lighting to be able to see the egg so crisply against the white background.  Also a good sense of humor in this picture.', '2008-04-10 10:14:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4629709, 666533, 58457, '<td valign="top">immediate feeling of the grimyness of this photo.  The texture on the hands and bars is great.  I only wish the brown tones in the BG were a bit more subtle--specifically the patch on the right, to me its a touch heavy.</td>', 'immediate feeling of the grimyness of this photo.  The texture on the hands and bars is great.  I only wish the brown tones in the BG were a bit more subtle--specifically the patch on the right, to me its a touch heavy.', '2008-04-10 10:16:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4629751, 666272, 33769, '<td valign="top">very creative- the warm lighting compliments the composition, and the shadows keep the image framed very nicely;  I do wish the finger was a little lighter- but I understand that the angle and shadowing potentially make it difficult (I gave this image a 10 overall because the highlights, shadows and -black areas  accentuate the subject- I tend to ignore the title when I look at compositions and i see multiple body parts in this composition, knuckles, armpit, breast, fingertip, curve and pad of a thumb (which compliments the curve of the breast)-- overall i think this image will rate rather high- i look forward to seeing who this image is by and gazing at other profile images to see what your still-lifes are like as well -</td>', 'very creative- the warm lighting compliments the composition, and the shadows keep the image framed very nicely;  I do wish the finger was a little lighter- but I understand that the angle and shadowing potentially make it difficult (I gave this image a 10 overall because the highlights, shadows and -black areas  accentuate the subject- I tend to ignore the title when I look at compositions and i see multiple body parts in this composition, knuckles, armpit, breast, fingertip, curve and pad of a thumb (which compliments the curve of the breast)-- overall i think this image will rate rather high- i look forward to seeing who this image is by and gazing at other profile images to see what your still-lifes are like as well -', '2008-04-10 10:33:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4629762, 666483, 33769, '<td valign="top">beautiful composition, I had a similar idea (but thought about it with feet standing in the center) when i was in boston the other day and decided against it; - now I wish I hadn''t; its a very well laid out composition, almost looking like the bursting of sun-rays from the hand- and or as if the stain itself is radiating from the hand...  ~10~</td>', 'beautiful composition, I had a similar idea (but thought about it with feet standing in the center) when i was in boston the other day and decided against it; - now I wish I hadn''t; its a very well laid out composition, almost looking like the bursting of sun-rays from the hand- and or as if the stain itself is radiating from the hand...  ~10~', '2008-04-10 10:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4629770, 665416, 33769, '<td valign="top">I love this image - its just great- the lipstick draws your eyes right to the teeth and tongue, and the expression is -great-  artistically done- i like the tonal range you chose for this just a little darker than high-key in the background, and the skin-tones remain natural and real)  -- another one that I gave  a 10 to because overall it''s a great image :)</td>', 'I love this image - its just great- the lipstick draws your eyes right to the teeth and tongue, and the expression is -great-  artistically done- i like the tonal range you chose for this just a little darker than high-key in the background, and the skin-tones remain natural and real)  -- another one that I gave  a 10 to because overall it''s a great image :)', '2008-04-10 10:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
