(4631255, 666500, 59415, '<td valign="top">There''s just a bit too much smoothing out a run the edges for me.  The problem is that it can''t be smooth once you hit the eyelashes, and some of the eyelashes are half missing which is a little weird to me.</td>', 'There''s just a bit too much smoothing out a run the edges for me.  The problem is that it can''t be smooth once you hit the eyelashes, and some of the eyelashes are half missing which is a little weird to me.', '2008-04-10 20:09:39.000000', NULL, 1),
