(4631261, 666359, 59415, '<td valign="top">ahh yes, the seasons almost here.  Good lighting and good composition.  It seems that the color of his hand is a bit "oranger" than it might be in real life.  It might be my monitor however.</td>', 'ahh yes, the seasons almost here.  Good lighting and good composition.  It seems that the color of his hand is a bit "oranger" than it might be in real life.  It might be my monitor however.', '2008-04-10 20:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
