(4631272, 666236, 59415, '<td valign="top">The old dirty hand.  As a pretty good shot that maybe could have benefited from a little bit more dramatic lighting.  The effect seems a little flat.  Everything''s well lay it however the lack of shadows doesn''t really present what the image might be trying to say.</td>', 'The old dirty hand.  As a pretty good shot that maybe could have benefited from a little bit more dramatic lighting.  The effect seems a little flat.  Everything''s well lay it however the lack of shadows doesn''t really present what the image might be trying to say.', '2008-04-10 20:14:53.000000', NULL, 1),
