(4631974, 666257, 59415, '<td valign="top">In 99% of the cases where I have seen contrasted and "effected" photos I dislike them.  This however is amazing!  I could look at this for a long time.  I hope it does well.  10 from me.</td>', 'In 99% of the cases where I have seen contrasted and "effected" photos I dislike them.  This however is amazing!  I could look at this for a long time.  I hope it does well.  10 from me.', '2008-04-11 01:20:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4631975, 666243, 59415, '<td valign="top">I like the BW effect.</td>', 'I like the BW effect.', '2008-04-11 01:20:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4631989, 664536, 59415, '<td valign="top">I hate it when hands are telling me what to do.  Just kidding, I agree with you.</td>', 'I hate it when hands are telling me what to do.  Just kidding, I agree with you.', '2008-04-11 01:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4631991, 666002, 59415, '<td valign="top">Like a big harry gorilla.</td>', 'Like a big harry gorilla.', '2008-04-11 01:27:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4631992, 666049, 59415, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting on this shot.  Love the DOF effect as well.  Now give it back!</td>', 'Nice lighting on this shot.  Love the DOF effect as well.  Now give it back!', '2008-04-11 01:27:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4631997, 666362, 59415, '<td valign="top">Very well done, I like this shot quite a bit.</td>', 'Very well done, I like this shot quite a bit.', '2008-04-11 01:28:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632000, 666247, 59415, '<td valign="top">What a well dressed young man.</td>', 'What a well dressed young man.', '2008-04-11 01:28:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632003, 666050, 59415, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent pose.  I think that it could benefit just a bit from some levels adjustments.</td>', 'This is an excellent pose.  I think that it could benefit just a bit from some levels adjustments.', '2008-04-11 01:29:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632004, 666324, 59415, '<td valign="top">Great tone here.  This is one of the best "hands" shots in the challenge.</td>', 'Great tone here.  This is one of the best "hands" shots in the challenge.', '2008-04-11 01:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632005, 665892, 25773, '<td valign="top">Wow, I have to learn this. I hope, I will see some description of the setup you used. It''s almost hypnotizing. I guess it should be a pretty fast and sharp lens, but I wonder about the lighting.<br/> <br/>10 from me (hope, it will count--&gt;I am lazy and I  might not get to the 20%).</td>', 'Wow, I have to learn this. I hope, I will see some description of the setup you used. It''s almost hypnotizing. I guess it should be a pretty fast and sharp lens, but I wonder about the lighting. 10 from me (hope, it will count-->I am lazy and I  might not get to the 20%).', '2008-04-11 01:30:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632007, 666134, 59415, '<td valign="top">I hope that red dressed person is a dude.  Other wise this challenge is just getting weird.</td>', 'I hope that red dressed person is a dude.  Other wise this challenge is just getting weird.', '2008-04-11 01:30:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632012, 666309, 59415, '<td valign="top">Oh my dear lord.  That is the side of this that I never wanted to see.  I will have nightmares for a week about somebody yanking bloody candy corns out of my mouth!</td>', 'Oh my dear lord.  That is the side of this that I never wanted to see.  I will have nightmares for a week about somebody yanking bloody candy corns out of my mouth!', '2008-04-11 01:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632014, 665784, 59415, '<td valign="top">Is she picking her nose?  And are you stalking her?  ...</td>', 'Is she picking her nose?  And are you stalking her?  ...', '2008-04-11 01:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632015, 665416, 59415, '<td valign="top">Well done photo.</td>', 'Well done photo.', '2008-04-11 01:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632018, 666183, 59415, '<td valign="top">Very nice black and white hand photo.  One of the best in the challenge.</td>', 'Very nice black and white hand photo.  One of the best in the challenge.', '2008-04-11 01:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632026, 666484, 59415, '<td valign="top">You are going to get a 5.5.  I see a 7 in your future, and yes...yes you will pick the million dollar case on deal or no deal and then trade it for $50 and some tickets to see Cher in Vegas...</td>', 'You are going to get a 5.5.  I see a 7 in your future, and yes...yes you will pick the million dollar case on deal or no deal and then trade it for $50 and some tickets to see Cher in Vegas...', '2008-04-11 01:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632030, 665998, 59415, '<td valign="top">This is my first elbow.</td>', 'This is my first elbow.', '2008-04-11 01:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632033, 666539, 25773, '<td valign="top">Great composition (I mean the picture); I feel the hand would need to be more in focus...</td>', 'Great composition (I mean the picture); I feel the hand would need to be more in focus...', '2008-04-11 01:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632036, 666293, 59415, '<td valign="top">Wouldn''t it be funny if you removed the vail and it was a dude.  That would crack me up.</td>', 'Wouldn''t it be funny if you removed the vail and it was a dude.  That would crack me up.', '2008-04-11 01:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632046, 666510, 59415, '<td valign="top">This is a nice soft image.</td>', 'This is a nice soft image.', '2008-04-11 01:39:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632048, 665231, 59415, '<td valign="top">It is like a steroid using ballet dancer.</td>', 'It is like a steroid using ballet dancer.', '2008-04-11 01:39:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632050, 666241, 59415, '<td valign="top">It looks like hands making out.  That is weird.</td>', 'It looks like hands making out.  That is weird.', '2008-04-11 01:39:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632051, 666502, 59415, '<td valign="top">Very cool use of simple color.  I like it.</td>', 'Very cool use of simple color.  I like it.', '2008-04-11 01:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632054, 666493, 59415, '<td valign="top">This is a good hands shot because the hand is doing something that it would normally do.  I like this shot very much.</td>', 'This is a good hands shot because the hand is doing something that it would normally do.  I like this shot very much.', '2008-04-11 01:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632055, 666538, 59415, '<td valign="top">There is some weirdness going on with the hand here.  I am sensing the use of some sort of filter, but it is a little strange to me.</td>', 'There is some weirdness going on with the hand here.  I am sensing the use of some sort of filter, but it is a little strange to me.', '2008-04-11 01:41:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632057, 666405, 59415, '<td valign="top">My eyes!  They burn.  This was probably the one image that I didn''t need to have stuck in my head forever.  Nothing against rob however.  He seems like a good guy with possibly a little bit of George Costanza envy.</td>', 'My eyes!  They burn.  This was probably the one image that I didn''t need to have stuck in my head forever.  Nothing against rob however.  He seems like a good guy with possibly a little bit of George Costanza envy.', '2008-04-11 01:44:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632058, 664476, 59415, '<td valign="top">Dang, why didn''t I think of this?</td>', 'Dang, why didn''t I think of this?', '2008-04-11 01:44:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632059, 666486, 59415, '<td valign="top">Nice soft image.</td>', 'Nice soft image.', '2008-04-11 01:44:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632060, 663991, 59415, '<td valign="top">Very artistic, but not my favorite image.  There just isn''t enough to focus on in this one, and there isn''t enough shape for it to be abstract.</td>', 'Very artistic, but not my favorite image.  There just isn''t enough to focus on in this one, and there isn''t enough shape for it to be abstract.', '2008-04-11 01:45:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632061, 666316, 59415, '<td valign="top">badum-tap!  Thank you, I will be here all week.</td>', 'badum-tap!  Thank you, I will be here all week.', '2008-04-11 01:45:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632063, 666323, 59415, '<td valign="top">I knew that bigfoot was real.  I kept telling everybody.</td>', 'I knew that bigfoot was real.  I kept telling everybody.', '2008-04-11 01:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632065, 666185, 59415, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent composition and a good image photography wise.  The subject however just isn''t enough to get me excited.</td>', 'This is an excellent composition and a good image photography wise.  The subject however just isn''t enough to get me excited.', '2008-04-11 01:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632066, 666542, 59415, '<td valign="top">This photo needs just a little something else.  I am not sure what, but it is missing something.</td>', 'This photo needs just a little something else.  I am not sure what, but it is missing something.', '2008-04-11 01:47:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632068, 666234, 59415, '<td valign="top">This is even better than the face sticking out.  I like the composition and the style of the image.  Nice job.</td>', 'This is even better than the face sticking out.  I like the composition and the style of the image.  Nice job.', '2008-04-11 01:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632069, 666337, 59415, '<td valign="top">Nice image.</td>', 'Nice image.', '2008-04-11 01:48:33.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4632071, 666444, 59415, '<td valign="top">My pants fit the same way, but it is from burritos.</td>', 'My pants fit the same way, but it is from burritos.', '2008-04-11 01:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632072, 665808, 59415, '<td valign="top">I think that you should have put the camera down and gone and helped this man.  I am not sure if he is breathing.</td>', 'I think that you should have put the camera down and gone and helped this man.  I am not sure if he is breathing.', '2008-04-11 01:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632073, 666488, 59415, '<td valign="top">For some reason the first thing that I think of when I see this photo besides, how the hell did he balance an egg on his head) is that band "The Presidents of the United States of America".  I could see them using this for an album cover and singing a song about eggs on your head.</td>', 'For some reason the first thing that I think of when I see this photo besides, how the hell did he balance an egg on his head) is that band "The Presidents of the United States of America".  I could see them using this for an album cover and singing a song about eggs on your head.', '2008-04-11 01:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632074, 666459, 59415, '<td valign="top">Very nice hand photo.</td>', 'Very nice hand photo.', '2008-04-11 01:50:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632075, 665284, 59415, '<td valign="top">This is a spooky shot.  Those eyelashes are all crazy.</td>', 'This is a spooky shot.  Those eyelashes are all crazy.', '2008-04-11 01:51:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632076, 666426, 59415, '<td valign="top">I like the concept, however I think that it could have been composed a little differently to add to the effect.</td>', 'I like the concept, however I think that it could have been composed a little differently to add to the effect.', '2008-04-11 01:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632078, 664874, 59415, '<td valign="top">I think that the table is my biggest problem with this shot.  I don''t like the grain on the table competing with the grain on the hands.</td>', 'I think that the table is my biggest problem with this shot.  I don''t like the grain on the table competing with the grain on the hands.', '2008-04-11 01:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632079, 666507, 59415, '<td valign="top">Well done shot all around.</td>', 'Well done shot all around.', '2008-04-11 01:53:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632082, 666326, 59415, '<td valign="top">This is a good photo, but I am not in love with the lighting.  It looks nice and I really don''t have any specific criticism I just don''t love the lighting. 7</td>', 'This is a good photo, but I am not in love with the lighting.  It looks nice and I really don''t have any specific criticism I just don''t love the lighting. 7', '2008-04-11 01:55:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632083, 666066, 59415, '<td valign="top">Those are very blue eyes.  This is a decent eye shot.</td>', 'Those are very blue eyes.  This is a decent eye shot.', '2008-04-11 01:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632084, 665981, 59415, '<td valign="top">Is this a commercial for TAG body spray?  I bet there is some dude under that pile who smells good.</td>', 'Is this a commercial for TAG body spray?  I bet there is some dude under that pile who smells good.', '2008-04-11 01:56:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632085, 665538, 59415, '<td valign="top">Looks like Meg Ryan in a wind storm.</td>', 'Looks like Meg Ryan in a wind storm.', '2008-04-11 01:56:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632087, 666533, 59415, '<td valign="top">Sorry if I am being sarcastic, but every hand in the entire challenge needs to be washed with soap.  That just seems weird to me.</td>', 'Sorry if I am being sarcastic, but every hand in the entire challenge needs to be washed with soap.  That just seems weird to me.', '2008-04-11 01:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632088, 666046, 59415, '<td valign="top">Great job.  This is freaky like a sci-fi movie.  I am waiting for the creature to come out and get me.</td>', 'Great job.  This is freaky like a sci-fi movie.  I am waiting for the creature to come out and get me.', '2008-04-11 01:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632090, 665979, 59415, '<td valign="top">Good photo work here.</td>', 'Good photo work here.', '2008-04-11 01:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632092, 664372, 59415, '<td valign="top">When you see if from this angle, you realize why God didn''t attach them that way.</td>', 'When you see if from this angle, you realize why God didn''t attach them that way.', '2008-04-11 01:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632094, 666246, 59415, '<td valign="top">This looks like a commercial for a faucet.  Well done.</td>', 'This looks like a commercial for a faucet.  Well done.', '2008-04-11 01:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632095, 666483, 59415, '<td valign="top">So this is how all of the hands in this challenge keep getting dirty.</td>', 'So this is how all of the hands in this challenge keep getting dirty.', '2008-04-11 01:59:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632097, 666194, 59415, '<td valign="top">I just don''t get this image.  I am not sure what is going on, and I am not fond of the "strangled" look of the hand.  But, photography is an art therefore subjective so who am I to say?</td>', 'I just don''t get this image.  I am not sure what is going on, and I am not fond of the "strangled" look of the hand.  But, photography is an art therefore subjective so who am I to say?', '2008-04-11 02:00:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632098, 666300, 59415, '<td valign="top">I like this shot.  It works well.</td>', 'I like this shot.  It works well.', '2008-04-11 02:00:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632099, 665223, 59415, '<td valign="top">I only see the booger, or slime or cream or whatever that is on the lip.</td>', 'I only see the booger, or slime or cream or whatever that is on the lip.', '2008-04-11 02:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632100, 666422, 59415, '<td valign="top">I have days like this, so I can relate to the emotion behind the photo.</td>', 'I have days like this, so I can relate to the emotion behind the photo.', '2008-04-11 02:01:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632101, 665892, 59415, '<td valign="top">Very nice green eyes.  Very cool.</td>', 'Very nice green eyes.  Very cool.', '2008-04-11 02:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632102, 666532, 59415, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of this image.</td>', 'I like the composition of this image.', '2008-04-11 02:02:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632104, 666196, 59415, '<td valign="top">I think that the contrast and lighting is just not working for me on this shot.</td>', 'I think that the contrast and lighting is just not working for me on this shot.', '2008-04-11 02:03:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632106, 666523, 59415, '<td valign="top">Was it cold?  Those hands are so red it looks like they are frozen.</td>', 'Was it cold?  Those hands are so red it looks like they are frozen.', '2008-04-11 02:04:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632108, 666530, 59415, '<td valign="top">This is a good image.  I am not sure that I like the crop on the bottom however.  The teeth are a bit distracting and I think there needed to be more or less of them in the frame.</td>', 'This is a good image.  I am not sure that I like the crop on the bottom however.  The teeth are a bit distracting and I think there needed to be more or less of them in the frame.', '2008-04-11 02:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632109, 666325, 59415, '<td valign="top">At least they won''t be forgetting what ever it is that they needed to remember.  Although the leather strap seems to mean that maybe they have permanently forgotten something.</td>', 'At least they won''t be forgetting what ever it is that they needed to remember.  Although the leather strap seems to mean that maybe they have permanently forgotten something.', '2008-04-11 02:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632111, 666221, 59415, '<td valign="top">Alright, a dirty hand!  Finally one in the challenge that wasn''t afraid to just dip the entire thing into a vat of oil and go for the gusto.<br/> <br/>Good tones on this shot, and the wrench adds a lot too.  7</td>', 'Alright, a dirty hand!  Finally one in the challenge that wasn''t afraid to just dip the entire thing into a vat of oil and go for the gusto. Good tones on this shot, and the wrench adds a lot too.  7', '2008-04-11 02:07:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632112, 666454, 59415, '<td valign="top">This is a good shot all around.</td>', 'This is a good shot all around.', '2008-04-11 02:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632113, 666238, 59415, '<td valign="top">A glass a day from what they say!</td>', 'A glass a day from what they say!', '2008-04-11 02:07:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632114, 665740, 59415, '<td valign="top">I look like that except without all the muscle.</td>', 'I look like that except without all the muscle.', '2008-04-11 02:08:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632121, 666122, 41337, '<td valign="top">Overall not a bad attempt. The colors are really good and the composition works. I would just work on refining the details more so that it''s cleaner and also maybe use a softer light. Having a little more shadows would also help give it more depth. That said, I can''t imagine the painting was easy so still a very good job. <br/> <br/>Btw, is the background a monitor display? The subtle pattern seems to suggest it, although it may just be some other artifact. If it is a monitor I would suggest blurring it more so that it doesn''t look like it''s a monitor.</td>', 'Overall not a bad attempt. The colors are really good and the composition works. I would just work on refining the details more so that it''s cleaner and also maybe use a softer light. Having a little more shadows would also help give it more depth. That said, I can''t imagine the painting was easy so still a very good job.  Btw, is the background a monitor display? The subtle pattern seems to suggest it, although it may just be some other artifact. If it is a monitor I would suggest blurring it more so that it doesn''t look like it''s a monitor.', '2008-04-11 02:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632123, 665784, 41337, '<td valign="top">Is that a TV? An interesting effect which seems to imprison it''s subject.</td>', 'Is that a TV? An interesting effect which seems to imprison it''s subject.', '2008-04-11 02:24:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632124, 665892, 41337, '<td valign="top">Wonderful focus. Nice to see some details in the skin, a rarity these days...</td>', 'Wonderful focus. Nice to see some details in the skin, a rarity these days...', '2008-04-11 02:26:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632126, 666518, 41337, '<td valign="top">An interesting pose. It conveys sadness to me. I suppose it''s because of the way the hand is falling away from the light at the top and into the darkness below. I doubt most will like the technicals but for me it''s perfect especially the focus and exposure. Good luck.</td>', 'An interesting pose. It conveys sadness to me. I suppose it''s because of the way the hand is falling away from the light at the top and into the darkness below. I doubt most will like the technicals but for me it''s perfect especially the focus and exposure. Good luck.', '2008-04-11 02:31:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632128, 666257, 41337, '<td valign="top">This has an almost renaissance feel to it. I like it.</td>', 'This has an almost renaissance feel to it. I like it.', '2008-04-11 02:34:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632141, 666515, 41337, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting. For the challenges, you would be better off pushing the colors more (ex. warm it or cool it more or saturated it more.)</td>', 'Nice lighting. For the challenges, you would be better off pushing the colors more (ex. warm it or cool it more or saturated it more.)', '2008-04-11 02:49:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632156, 665416, 53121, '<td valign="top">Pure comedy. Love it :)</td>', 'Pure comedy. Love it :)', '2008-04-11 02:55:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632158, 666326, 53121, '<td valign="top">Wow. Great details and nice use of lighting.</td>', 'Wow. Great details and nice use of lighting.', '2008-04-11 02:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632159, 666084, 53121, '<td valign="top">I love the simplicity and the super smooth tones.</td>', 'I love the simplicity and the super smooth tones.', '2008-04-11 02:56:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632207, 666247, 49109, '<td valign="top">very good OOB entry. wished this was in b/w, color does nothing for the image while b/w had probably created more impact</td>', 'very good OOB entry. wished this was in b/w, color does nothing for the image while b/w had probably created more impact', '2008-04-11 04:56:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632208, 666323, 49109, '<td valign="top">nice trick, like this. contrast could be a bit higher.</td>', 'nice trick, like this. contrast could be a bit higher.', '2008-04-11 04:56:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632209, 666272, 49109, '<td valign="top">very good focus and  lighting - funny title... crop at bottom and left is a little close; a bit oversaturated and oversharpened</td>', 'very good focus and  lighting - funny title... crop at bottom and left is a little close; a bit oversaturated and oversharpened', '2008-04-11 04:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632210, 666506, 49109, '<td valign="top">not really in the spirit of the challenge, funny and technically good picture though</td>', 'not really in the spirit of the challenge, funny and technically good picture though', '2008-04-11 04:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632211, 666309, 49109, '<td valign="top">most unusual entry probably... a bit too soft , drawn tooth and face could have been a tad brighter</td>', 'most unusual entry probably... a bit too soft , drawn tooth and face could have been a tad brighter', '2008-04-11 04:58:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632481, 665932, 59415, '<td valign="top">This is a decent version of dramatic lighting.  I like the detailed but I think it would be better if there''s just a little more DOF.</td>', 'This is a decent version of dramatic lighting.  I like the detailed but I think it would be better if there''s just a little more DOF.', '2008-04-11 10:21:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632826, 665836, 70000, '<td valign="top">beautiful studio portrait! I love the colors and expression</td>', 'beautiful studio portrait! I love the colors and expression', '2008-04-11 12:17:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632828, 666156, 70000, '<td valign="top">awesome detail and colors</td>', 'awesome detail and colors', '2008-04-11 12:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632831, 665799, 70000, '<td valign="top">The noise here is a little more distracting than helpful it seems. lovely composition though and great job getting all the hands in harmony</td>', 'The noise here is a little more distracting than helpful it seems. lovely composition though and great job getting all the hands in harmony', '2008-04-11 12:18:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632845, 665836, 36382, '<td valign="top">This is a nice fun shot.  The lighting looks good.  I like the tight crop, too.</td>', 'This is a nice fun shot.  The lighting looks good.  I like the tight crop, too.', '2008-04-11 12:22:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632846, 665864, 36382, '<td valign="top">Good picture.  I like the idea.  It came out well.</td>', 'Good picture.  I like the idea.  It came out well.', '2008-04-11 12:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632849, 666540, 36382, '<td valign="top">This is good.  I like the compressed perspective of the buildings on the right.</td>', 'This is good.  I like the compressed perspective of the buildings on the right.', '2008-04-11 12:23:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632855, 666437, 36382, '<td valign="top">Good.  Conveys a lot, even though only the hands are visible.</td>', 'Good.  Conveys a lot, even though only the hands are visible.', '2008-04-11 12:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
