(4635615, 666345, 90658, '<td valign="top">I really enjoy seeing the dimensions added by the colors.</td>', 'I really enjoy seeing the dimensions added by the colors.', '2008-04-12 22:07:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4635619, 666542, 90658, '<td valign="top">Interesting image.  I almost feel as if it is a weensy bit too dark.  There is quite a lot of intricate imagery that is getting lost.</td>', 'Interesting image.  I almost feel as if it is a weensy bit too dark.  There is quite a lot of intricate imagery that is getting lost.', '2008-04-12 22:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4635621, 666264, 90658, '<td valign="top">There''s just something missing for me.  This seems like it should really pop when viewed in thumbnail, but is slightly dead looking in the larger version.  Perhaps the eye is not communicating emotion.</td>', 'There''s just something missing for me.  This seems like it should really pop when viewed in thumbnail, but is slightly dead looking in the larger version.  Perhaps the eye is not communicating emotion.', '2008-04-12 22:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4635624, 666359, 90658, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure the white was the best choice of background.  There is an orangish tinge to the skin that could have been subdued with some color behind everything.</td>', 'I''m not sure the white was the best choice of background.  There is an orangish tinge to the skin that could have been subdued with some color behind everything.', '2008-04-12 22:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4635627, 666325, 90658, '<td valign="top">The texture capture is very nice.</td>', 'The texture capture is very nice.', '2008-04-12 22:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4635630, 665284, 90658, '<td valign="top">The eye seems dead.  There is no life or spark behind it.</td>', 'The eye seems dead.  There is no life or spark behind it.', '2008-04-12 22:12:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4635633, 665538, 90658, '<td valign="top">This is almost spectural and ghostly.  There is a haunted look within the face and the hair swept back like it is adds movement towards the viewer.  All together, this is an interesting shot to look at.</td>', 'This is almost spectural and ghostly.  There is a haunted look within the face and the hair swept back like it is adds movement towards the viewer.  All together, this is an interesting shot to look at.', '2008-04-12 22:14:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4635635, 666156, 90658, '<td valign="top">Way to use reflection to your benefit.</td>', 'Way to use reflection to your benefit.', '2008-04-12 22:14:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4635637, 666243, 90658, '<td valign="top">Wow, he is sure holding those sticks tightly.  Your downfall is my experience as a musician.  I am in a band and deal with drummers all the time, loose hands make better drumming.  The shot is interesting to look at though.</td>', 'Wow, he is sure holding those sticks tightly.  Your downfall is my experience as a musician.  I am in a band and deal with drummers all the time, loose hands make better drumming.  The shot is interesting to look at though.', '2008-04-12 22:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4635640, 666007, 90658, '<td valign="top">I think you have some color shading issues around the edges of the hands.  You have that old "green screen" effect going...the one in older movies where you can see where the images are imposed on other images.</td>', 'I think you have some color shading issues around the edges of the hands.  You have that old "green screen" effect going...the one in older movies where you can see where the images are imposed on other images.', '2008-04-12 22:17:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4635668, 665739, 70888, '<td valign="top">best eyeshot so far...great</td>', 'best eyeshot so far...great', '2008-04-12 22:29:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4635707, 666101, 90658, '<td valign="top">Interesting view.</td>', 'Interesting view.', '2008-04-12 22:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4635711, 666309, 90658, '<td valign="top">Freaky view!</td>', 'Freaky view!', '2008-04-12 22:43:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4635715, 666196, 90658, '<td valign="top">I like the play of the colors.  Yellow vs Purple vs Flesh.</td>', 'I like the play of the colors.  Yellow vs Purple vs Flesh.', '2008-04-12 22:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4635735, 666234, 90658, '<td valign="top">Fantastic imagery!!</td>', 'Fantastic imagery!!', '2008-04-12 22:51:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4635737, 666265, 90658, '<td valign="top">A little squinshy, but at least there is emotion in the eye.</td>', 'A little squinshy, but at least there is emotion in the eye.', '2008-04-12 22:52:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4635739, 666437, 90658, '<td valign="top">Way to communicate the tenderness.</td>', 'Way to communicate the tenderness.', '2008-04-12 22:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4635740, 666002, 90658, '<td valign="top">A little too dark for my tastes.</td>', 'A little too dark for my tastes.', '2008-04-12 22:52:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4635743, 665808, 90658, '<td valign="top">Way to capture the beauty of the human body.</td>', 'Way to capture the beauty of the human body.', '2008-04-12 22:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4635746, 666354, 90658, '<td valign="top">For me, this is just a damp breast.  Sorry.<br/> <br/>There are many ways to capture the beauty of the human body and for some reason this does not do it for me.</td>', 'For me, this is just a damp breast.  Sorry. There are many ways to capture the beauty of the human body and for some reason this does not do it for me.', '2008-04-12 22:54:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4635748, 666446, 90658, '<td valign="top">The elegance here is wonderful.</td>', 'The elegance here is wonderful.', '2008-04-12 22:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4635750, 666098, 90658, '<td valign="top">The shading is wonderful.</td>', 'The shading is wonderful.', '2008-04-12 22:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4635753, 666307, 90658, '<td valign="top">Playful.  Almost a candid, but for me it actually crosses into a portrait.</td>', 'Playful.  Almost a candid, but for me it actually crosses into a portrait.', '2008-04-12 22:56:19.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4635756, 666483, 90658, '<td valign="top">Love the imagery here.</td>', 'Love the imagery here.', '2008-04-12 22:56:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4635758, 666532, 90658, '<td valign="top">Nicely captured!</td>', 'Nicely captured!', '2008-04-12 22:57:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4635761, 665892, 90658, '<td valign="top">The eyes actually communicate something.  The intensity that you captured is incredible.</td>', 'The eyes actually communicate something.  The intensity that you captured is incredible.', '2008-04-12 22:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4635774, 665799, 90658, '<td valign="top">I little too noisy for my tastes, but I like the design.</td>', 'I little too noisy for my tastes, but I like the design.', '2008-04-12 23:01:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4635883, 666371, 90474, '<td valign="top">I like the exposure</td>', 'I like the exposure', '2008-04-13 00:49:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4635892, 666530, 90474, '<td valign="top">You''ve captured the joy of this child.  Some might say that it is soft, but i sya perfect.  They don''t stay in focus very long.</td>', 'You''ve captured the joy of this child.  Some might say that it is soft, but i sya perfect.  They don''t stay in focus very long.', '2008-04-13 01:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4635893, 664476, 90474, '<td valign="top">This is a good idea.  I have mine marked TGIF on the top, but I''ll have to add this to the bottom.  (Toes Gon In First)</td>', 'This is a good idea.  I have mine marked TGIF on the top, but I''ll have to add this to the bottom.  (Toes Gon In First)', '2008-04-13 01:00:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4635910, 666272, 66310, '<td valign="top">I think I like your finger. Very creative.....great shadows, light and tone.......oh, and still love that finger!</td>', 'I think I like your finger. Very creative.....great shadows, light and tone.......oh, and still love that finger!', '2008-04-13 01:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4635911, 666354, 66310, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous!! And I like the lack of gravity in this shot too ;0)</td>', 'Gorgeous!! And I like the lack of gravity in this shot too ;0)', '2008-04-13 01:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4635912, 664446, 66310, '<td valign="top">I really like the concept, but the focus is on the hair, therefore blurring the eye.</td>', 'I really like the concept, but the focus is on the hair, therefore blurring the eye.', '2008-04-13 01:33:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4635915, 666419, 66310, '<td valign="top">OK. I am officially in love now......great shot!</td>', 'OK. I am officially in love now......great shot!', '2008-04-13 01:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4635918, 666426, 66310, '<td valign="top">powerful!</td>', 'powerful!', '2008-04-13 01:37:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4635919, 665559, 25773, '<td valign="top">I don''t really get it... Those don''t look like tears (unless from seriously infected eyes).</td>', 'I don''t really get it... Those don''t look like tears (unless from seriously infected eyes).', '2008-04-13 01:37:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4635921, 666328, 90474, '<td valign="top">The hands have a slight yellow cast.  I like the photo, so if the yellow was intentional, dismiss the comment.</td>', 'The hands have a slight yellow cast.  I like the photo, so if the yellow was intentional, dismiss the comment.', '2008-04-13 01:39:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4635922, 666236, 90474, '<td valign="top">Could be a good add for a nursery.  a little too much light on the fingers.</td>', 'Could be a good add for a nursery.  a little too much light on the fingers.', '2008-04-13 01:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4635923, 666538, 90474, '<td valign="top">Post processing get a little out of "hand"?</td>', 'Post processing get a little out of "hand"?', '2008-04-13 01:43:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4635927, 666120, 66310, '<td valign="top">fun!</td>', 'fun!', '2008-04-13 01:44:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4635929, 666309, 25773, '<td valign="top">I really like the idea. I would have liked it better if instead of the fake oral cavity/teath the dentist''s eyes/face were in focus (although I have to agree, this focus is more consistent with the title).</td>', 'I really like the idea. I would have liked it better if instead of the fake oral cavity/teath the dentist''s eyes/face were in focus (although I have to agree, this focus is more consistent with the title).', '2008-04-13 01:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4635932, 666293, 90474, '<td valign="top">it appears that the fabric over the nose was the focus point, leaving the eyes a bit soft.</td>', 'it appears that the fabric over the nose was the focus point, leaving the eyes a bit soft.', '2008-04-13 01:51:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4635952, 666303, 90474, '<td valign="top">I''m captured.</td>', 'I''m captured.', '2008-04-13 03:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4635953, 666169, 90474, '<td valign="top">The shape of the catchlight is the only thing holding this back</td>', 'The shape of the catchlight is the only thing holding this back', '2008-04-13 03:09:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4636189, 666293, 78196, '<td valign="top">A nice idea and beautiful eyes but the lighting and contrast seem rather harsh and detail is lost in darker areas (especially around her right eye) which is rather distracting.</td>', 'A nice idea and beautiful eyes but the lighting and contrast seem rather harsh and detail is lost in darker areas (especially around her right eye) which is rather distracting.', '2008-04-13 09:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4636195, 666120, 78196, '<td valign="top">This one tells a story alright! Well processed.</td>', 'This one tells a story alright! Well processed.', '2008-04-13 09:35:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4636196, 665428, 78196, '<td valign="top">Awesome processing on this one.</td>', 'Awesome processing on this one.', '2008-04-13 09:36:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4636200, 666046, 78196, '<td valign="top">Very nicely lit - personally I would lose the material at the bottom as it become out of focus and distracts the great job you''ve done on that spine!</td>', 'Very nicely lit - personally I would lose the material at the bottom as it become out of focus and distracts the great job you''ve done on that spine!', '2008-04-13 09:38:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4636204, 666426, 78196, '<td valign="top">A brave choice of subject - unfortunately the intended effect is diminished by flat lighting and the rose, which in my opinion at least is unnecessary.</td>', 'A brave choice of subject - unfortunately the intended effect is diminished by flat lighting and the rose, which in my opinion at least is unnecessary.', '2008-04-13 09:40:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4636208, 665784, 78196, '<td valign="top">Thank you for being different. An intriguing shot that holds the attention - the shapes and reflections have a mesmerizing quality.</td>', 'Thank you for being different. An intriguing shot that holds the attention - the shapes and reflections have a mesmerizing quality.', '2008-04-13 09:42:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4636213, 666516, 78196, '<td valign="top">Excellent. I wish you hadn''t cut the feet in half quite so ruthlessly but a very original take on the challenge, lit very well.</td>', 'Excellent. I wish you hadn''t cut the feet in half quite so ruthlessly but a very original take on the challenge, lit very well.', '2008-04-13 09:45:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4636218, 666540, 78196, '<td valign="top">Terrific. A thoroughly original take on the challenge, superbly composed and exposed. My highest scorer so far.</td>', 'Terrific. A thoroughly original take on the challenge, superbly composed and exposed. My highest scorer so far.', '2008-04-13 09:47:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4636219, 666378, 78196, '<td valign="top">I don''t really enjoy this type of processing but here you''ve created something quite mesmerizing. Good job.</td>', 'I don''t really enjoy this type of processing but here you''ve created something quite mesmerizing. Good job.', '2008-04-13 09:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4636221, 665538, 78196, '<td valign="top">Absolutely superb lighting and control of aperture, the latter works incredibly well with her hair. I like the blank expression too.</td>', 'Absolutely superb lighting and control of aperture, the latter works incredibly well with her hair. I like the blank expression too.', '2008-04-13 09:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4636222, 666419, 78196, '<td valign="top">Superbly composed high-key.</td>', 'Superbly composed high-key.', '2008-04-13 09:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4636224, 666399, 78196, '<td valign="top">It''s so difficult to judge whether or not processing is overdone - for me you''ve gone a couple of steps too far. The haloing gives the game away and detracts from the strength of the image.</td>', 'It''s so difficult to judge whether or not processing is overdone - for me you''ve gone a couple of steps too far. The haloing gives the game away and detracts from the strength of the image.', '2008-04-13 09:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4636227, 666542, 78196, '<td valign="top">Great. But you needed to burn some more at the bottom - it''s partly my laptop screen but I can still see the background fabric in places which is a pity as it does slightly lessen the effect of the effective work you''ve done in the centre.</td>', 'Great. But you needed to burn some more at the bottom - it''s partly my laptop screen but I can still see the background fabric in places which is a pity as it does slightly lessen the effect of the effective work you''ve done in the centre.', '2008-04-13 09:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4636239, 666488, 55822, '<td valign="top">I will say this just makes me laugh. The lighting is perfect for this. Great job.</td>', 'I will say this just makes me laugh. The lighting is perfect for this. Great job.', '2008-04-13 10:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4636240, 666483, 55822, '<td valign="top">This is one of the most original hand shots I''ve seen in a long time. Nice use of desaturation.</td>', 'This is one of the most original hand shots I''ve seen in a long time. Nice use of desaturation.', '2008-04-13 10:34:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4636244, 665416, 55822, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lips, the red totally stands out and contrasts great with the pearly whites.</td>', 'Beautiful lips, the red totally stands out and contrasts great with the pearly whites.', '2008-04-13 10:36:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4636245, 666331, 55822, '<td valign="top">Great pose and lighting. I''m not skure I like the sepia on this but otherwise great shot.</td>', 'Great pose and lighting. I''m not skure I like the sepia on this but otherwise great shot.', '2008-04-13 10:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4636246, 666510, 55822, '<td valign="top">Love the high key of this.</td>', 'Love the high key of this.', '2008-04-13 10:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4636247, 666272, 55822, '<td valign="top">Very sharp, great lighting. Great shot.</td>', 'Very sharp, great lighting. Great shot.', '2008-04-13 10:40:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4636250, 666419, 55822, '<td valign="top">At first I didn''t see the eye looking at me. When I did, wow. Her eye gives this image so much more power, and perfectly balanced with the high key body.</td>', 'At first I didn''t see the eye looking at me. When I did, wow. Her eye gives this image so much more power, and perfectly balanced with the high key body.', '2008-04-13 10:42:46.000000', NULL, 1),
