(4636318, 666326, 90658, '<td valign="top">Sometimes a second look is a good thing...<br/> <br/>At first, I didn''t quite get this, but after coming back to it, I think I do.  I generally don''t like it when the focal point is smack dab in the middle (unless the entire image is in in focus), but this one is growing on me.</td>', 'Sometimes a second look is a good thing... At first, I didn''t quite get this, but after coming back to it, I think I do.  I generally don''t like it when the focal point is smack dab in the middle (unless the entire image is in in focus), but this one is growing on me.', '2008-04-13 11:52:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4636320, 665560, 90658, '<td valign="top">The justaposition of the hardened hands displayed in a soft manner is interesting, however, for me, I lose the story.  Don''t stop attempting these shots, because I am only one person.</td>', 'The justaposition of the hardened hands displayed in a soft manner is interesting, however, for me, I lose the story.  Don''t stop attempting these shots, because I am only one person.', '2008-04-13 11:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4636324, 666422, 90658, '<td valign="top">Despair, flirtation, shyness, embarassment...I actually need more information to understand the story here.</td>', 'Despair, flirtation, shyness, embarassment...I actually need more information to understand the story here.', '2008-04-13 11:56:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4636327, 666378, 90658, '<td valign="top">Gory, slightly gross, yet this works in a way that I cannot place my finger on.</td>', 'Gory, slightly gross, yet this works in a way that I cannot place my finger on.', '2008-04-13 11:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4636328, 666533, 90658, '<td valign="top">Too much processing for my tastes.  My personal rule of thumb is...<br/> <br/>either process to enhance something that is missing, or go so far that you create something unexpected.<br/> <br/>Neither of which I see, sorry.<br/> <br/>Art speaks differently to different people.</td>', 'Too much processing for my tastes.  My personal rule of thumb is... either process to enhance something that is missing, or go so far that you create something unexpected. Neither of which I see, sorry. Art speaks differently to different people.', '2008-04-13 11:59:02.000000', NULL, 1),
