(4636332, 666507, 90658, '<td valign="top">The coloring may be too bright.  I actually like the fact that I can see the action in the back.  The story is more complete.  Some people might have issues and suggest more blur on the back.</td>', 'The coloring may be too bright.  I actually like the fact that I can see the action in the back.  The story is more complete.  Some people might have issues and suggest more blur on the back.', '2008-04-13 12:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
