(4636335, 666500, 90658, '<td valign="top">The reflection in the pupil diminishes any personality or twinkle that might have been there.  This could be a glass eye for all I can tell.</td>', 'The reflection in the pupil diminishes any personality or twinkle that might have been there.  This could be a glass eye for all I can tell.', '2008-04-13 12:03:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4636337, 666122, 90658, '<td valign="top">Stunning use of colors in the background.  The artist that painted the hand is obviously very good at what they do, as well.  I''d be surprised if this didn''t make at least the top 15.</td>', 'Stunning use of colors in the background.  The artist that painted the hand is obviously very good at what they do, as well.  I''d be surprised if this didn''t make at least the top 15.', '2008-04-13 12:05:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4636340, 665830, 90658, '<td valign="top">Intersting reflection in the eye.  Most times, I would give a lower vote for something like that, but this time, there is a story being told in that reflection.  You can see what the child is interested in, it adds a bit of personality to your subject.</td>', 'Intersting reflection in the eye.  Most times, I would give a lower vote for something like that, but this time, there is a story being told in that reflection.  You can see what the child is interested in, it adds a bit of personality to your subject.', '2008-04-13 12:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4636354, 666363, 90658, '<td valign="top">hmmm.<br/> <br/>First of all the white background does nothing for this.  It washes out the skin tone.<br/> <br/>Second, the blue is a bit much.  It actually draws my attention to the butt and torso instead of the hips.<br/> <br/>Third, the black shoes, well the feet in general, are not important to this shot and could be cropped out, imo.<br/> <br/>I do like the waist jewelry, as it surrounds and brings attention to the hips/waist.  The dangle actually falling to the hip level is what does it.</td>', 'hmmm. First of all the white background does nothing for this.  It washes out the skin tone. Second, the blue is a bit much.  It actually draws my attention to the butt and torso instead of the hips. Third, the black shoes, well the feet in general, are not important to this shot and could be cropped out, imo. I do like the waist jewelry, as it surrounds and brings attention to the hips/waist.  The dangle actually falling to the hip level is what does it.', '2008-04-13 12:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4636362, 666344, 90658, '<td valign="top">The shape, relaxation and placement of this hand indicates someone intimately knowledgable of the piano.  The reflection in the keys is wonderful as well.  This is a great shot.</td>', 'The shape, relaxation and placement of this hand indicates someone intimately knowledgable of the piano.  The reflection in the keys is wonderful as well.  This is a great shot.', '2008-04-13 12:22:54.000000', NULL, 1),
