(4637580, 666488, 33769, '<td valign="top">I like this image a lot- i''m trying to figure out why someone gave you a 1 unless they were just attempting to ''boost'' their own scores? it fits the challenge, the lighting is beautiful, there is a twist of humor to it, its fully sharp and in focus - it would be interesting to see what that persons photos look like? (makes me kinda wish we could see the ''users that post below 4''s photos)</td>', 'I like this image a lot- i''m trying to figure out why someone gave you a 1 unless they were just attempting to ''boost'' their own scores? it fits the challenge, the lighting is beautiful, there is a twist of humor to it, its fully sharp and in focus - it would be interesting to see what that persons photos look like? (makes me kinda wish we could see the ''users that post below 4''s photos)', '2008-04-14 01:11:11.000000', NULL, 0),
