(4637588, 666523, 60173, '<td valign="top">I guess you could say the hands themselves are distracting.<br/> <br/>I saw this during voting, but wasn''t sure if I should comment on the actual hands. I Googled around a bit, because to me unless those were cold or overworked hands, this person may want to see a doctor. Hopefully this isn''t a common occurrence. I saw some cases where it''s just poor circulation, but there were also some mention of liver disease and whatnot.<br/> <br/>Again, I hope these hands were just cold after some good hard work.</td>', 'I guess you could say the hands themselves are distracting. I saw this during voting, but wasn''t sure if I should comment on the actual hands. I Googled around a bit, because to me unless those were cold or overworked hands, this person may want to see a doctor. Hopefully this isn''t a common occurrence. I saw some cases where it''s just poor circulation, but there were also some mention of liver disease and whatnot. Again, I hope these hands were just cold after some good hard work.', '2008-04-14 01:12:30.000000', NULL, 0),
