(4637614, 666483, 41337, '<td valign="top">Gotta agree with Langdon. I was expecting this to be on the front page. It got my second highest vote and if I wasn''t so lazy would have won a YankO too.<br/> <br/>ETA: Actually, I''ll give it to you anyway. You shouldn''t have to pay for my lazyness. :P<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/41337/orig/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_657189.gif'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/41337/orig/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_657189.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/41337/orig/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_657189.gif"/><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-04-14 00:22:00.</i></td>', 'Gotta agree with Langdon. I was expecting this to be on the front page. It got my second highest vote and if I wasn''t so lazy would have won a YankO too. ETA: Actually, I''ll give it to you anyway. You shouldn''t have to pay for my lazyness. :P ', '2008-04-14 01:18:44.000000', '2008-04-14 01:22:00.000000', 0),
