(4637621, 666085, 68947, '<td valign="top">OMG......this is a great image! A dirty hand, <b>daintily</b> picks up a hankerchief, trying not to dirty it!  <br/> <br/>Contrary to some voter''s tastes.....I think that the processing actually MAKES this shot.  <br/> <br/>But, then again, there''s always going to be those who will want you to rip out a wall, change the color of someone''s hair, pose the model upside down and completely overhaul your shot in order for them to "like it"! *grin*<br/> <br/>Great Job Michelle!  I didn''t vote in this challenge, but I love this shot! Keep up the good work.  Just because it doesn''t fit into DPC challenge "criteria" of "pretty", doesn''t mean that it lacks value and merit elsewhere! *smile*<br/> <br/>PS: Perhaps, a "dirty booby" might have scored higher!  But, then again, one never knows in here! *wink*<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-04-14 00:21:04.</i></td>', 'OMG......this is a great image! A dirty hand, daintily picks up a hankerchief, trying not to dirty it!   Contrary to some voter''s tastes.....I think that the processing actually MAKES this shot.   But, then again, there''s always going to be those who will want you to rip out a wall, change the color of someone''s hair, pose the model upside down and completely overhaul your shot in order for them to "like it"! *grin* Great Job Michelle!  I didn''t vote in this challenge, but I love this shot! Keep up the good work.  Just because it doesn''t fit into DPC challenge "criteria" of "pretty", doesn''t mean that it lacks value and merit elsewhere! *smile* PS: Perhaps, a "dirty booby" might have scored higher!  But, then again, one never knows in here! *wink*', '2008-04-14 01:19:26.000000', '2008-04-14 01:21:04.000000', 0),
