(4638125, 666419, 27133, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Larus:</b></div><hr/><i> A year ago or so I was browsing photo.net and saw a shot that I really liked that inspired this photo, I don´t remember where I found it though so I can´t link to it, if anybody recognizes it from this shot, by all means post a link to it.  </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Here was my version of this same image that I did back in November 2006.  I used it in my 2007 Calendar and I had it on my <a href="//judiliosatos.deviantart.com/" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Deviantart </a>account since January 2007.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=669256" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/hidden.png?1'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/hidden.png?1'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/hidden.png?1"/></a> <br/> <br/>Here is the link to the original photographer.<br/> <br/><a href="//saschahuettenhain.deviantart.com/art/eyekey-26557730" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">- eyekey - by ~SaschaHuettenhain</a> <br/> <br/>BTW....a huge congratson first place.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-04-14 05:17:38.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by Larus: A year ago or so I was browsing photo.net and saw a shot that I really liked that inspired this photo, I don´t remember where I found it though so I can´t link to it, if anybody recognizes it from this shot, by all means post a link to it.    Here was my version of this same image that I did back in November 2006.  I used it in my 2007 Calendar and I had it on my Deviantart account since January 2007.   Here is the link to the original photographer. - eyekey - by ~SaschaHuettenhain  BTW....a huge congratson first place.', '2008-04-14 06:16:16.000000', '2008-04-14 06:17:38.000000', 0),
