(4642096, 665559, 25773, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by smardaz:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by redpanda:</b></div><hr/><i> I don''t really get it... Those don''t look like tears (unless from seriously infected eyes). </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>you never heard the old expression "don''t cry over spilled milk"?<br/> <br/>awesome shot by the way </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>My bad, I am sorry. Indeed I have never heard this expression; the English is my second language and somehow I have just never been exposed to this phrase yet. Well, I learned something today...</td>', 'Originally posted by smardaz: Originally posted by redpanda: I don''t really get it... Those don''t look like tears (unless from seriously infected eyes).   you never heard the old expression "don''t cry over spilled milk"? awesome shot by the way   My bad, I am sorry. Indeed I have never heard this expression; the English is my second language and somehow I have just never been exposed to this phrase yet. Well, I learned something today...', '2008-04-16 01:11:22.000000', NULL, 0),
