(4642525, 665223, 72200, '<td valign="top">Freakin'' art fags on this site...they don''t get the concept of a candid shot (based on previous comments...ewww, booger...gross!). They''ll spend 40 hours in a studio trying to get a picture of a wine glass so they can prove how ''original'' and ''creative'' they are...all to win an imaginary ribbon. I guess you should have wiped his nose and set up some extra lights so it would saturate the color of his poverty more?!? While I admit that the focus is more on the forehead than eyes, it is a very moving image. Don''t listen to these tards...keep up the good work. Don''t even know why they''d request the original for this...doesn''t look like it broke any rules?<br/></td>', 'Freakin'' art fags on this site...they don''t get the concept of a candid shot (based on previous comments...ewww, booger...gross!). They''ll spend 40 hours in a studio trying to get a picture of a wine glass so they can prove how ''original'' and ''creative'' they are...all to win an imaginary ribbon. I guess you should have wiped his nose and set up some extra lights so it would saturate the color of his poverty more?!? While I admit that the focus is more on the forehead than eyes, it is a very moving image. Don''t listen to these tards...keep up the good work. Don''t even know why they''d request the original for this...doesn''t look like it broke any rules?', '2008-04-16 03:10:01.000000', NULL, 0),
