(4642877, 666236, 30982, '<td valign="top">Congrats on a top ten!  Very much within the guidelines of "how to score well at DPC" - clean, uncluttered composition, great light, clearly identified subject.  Good work!</td>', 'Congrats on a top ten!  Very much within the guidelines of "how to score well at DPC" - clean, uncluttered composition, great light, clearly identified subject.  Good work!', '2008-04-16 07:28:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(4642888, 666435, 30982, '<td valign="top">If you look at your voting breakdown, you''ll see that the voting audience is somewhat divided on highkey abstractish stuff.  There are those who REALLY like it when it''s well done (and this is) - those are the relatively high numbers of 7-10s.  Then there are those who really DON''T like high key and/or subtle - those are unfortunately the 1-4s and they overtook your 7-10s.  As I said, though, it is very well done - and despite the score you achieved your goal, I think.</td>', 'If you look at your voting breakdown, you''ll see that the voting audience is somewhat divided on highkey abstractish stuff.  There are those who REALLY like it when it''s well done (and this is) - those are the relatively high numbers of 7-10s.  Then there are those who really DON''T like high key and/or subtle - those are unfortunately the 1-4s and they overtook your 7-10s.  As I said, though, it is very well done - and despite the score you achieved your goal, I think.', '2008-04-16 07:31:36.000000', NULL, 0),
