(4645364, 666085, 33769, '<td valign="top">I try not to pay too much attention to titles- since more times than not too little attention s paid to an image in my opinion :) I think your composition is graceful and nicely done- sharp and creates beautiful shapes; the lighting/shadows are well executed- and its a pity this didn''t finish much higher</td>', 'I try not to pay too much attention to titles- since more times than not too little attention s paid to an image in my opinion :) I think your composition is graceful and nicely done- sharp and creates beautiful shapes; the lighting/shadows are well executed- and its a pity this didn''t finish much higher', '2008-04-17 08:08:25.000000', NULL, 0),
