(4760770, 666331, 43463, '<td valign="top">Finally getting back to the June before &amp; after side challenge postings. Wonderful editing job you did here! You did an excellent job pulling out the details from the original. The tonal range on her skin is excellent with barely a shadow to hide the features of her face. Her eyes, especially the one on the right, is much more visible to look upon here in the final edit. Love the sepia for it adds a bit of an timeless classic feel to this portrait.</td>', 'Finally getting back to the June before & after side challenge postings. Wonderful editing job you did here! You did an excellent job pulling out the details from the original. The tonal range on her skin is excellent with barely a shadow to hide the features of her face. Her eyes, especially the one on the right, is much more visible to look upon here in the final edit. Love the sepia for it adds a bit of an timeless classic feel to this portrait.', '2008-06-10 00:19:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(4768177, 666120, 12611, '<td valign="top">"Dude, is that like boobs?"<br/>"I think so man"<br/>"no way dude"<br/>"yeah dude"<br/>"cool"<br/> <br/>sorry for the dialogue. great shot. This is a scene from life that I wouldn''t see in a million years, you not only see it, but freeze the story in a photo. just great.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-08-06 22:34:04.</i></td>', '"Dude, is that like boobs?""I think so man""no way dude""yeah dude""cool" sorry for the dialogue. great shot. This is a scene from life that I wouldn''t see in a million years, you not only see it, but freeze the story in a photo. just great.', '2008-06-14 00:54:00.000000', '2008-08-06 23:34:04.000000', 0),
(4815629, 666434, 30807, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful contrast between the flaky, old, dried look to the meaty older hand, and the smooth, almost transparent waxy look to the baby hand. (apologies if it is your hand, no offense!)<br/> <br/>I have never seen such a telling contrast - usually it is a mother''s lovely smooth hand, and the baby''s whole hand wrapped round one finger - this jolts me somehow - I feel my age more when I see this - it is so like my hand!</td>', 'What a wonderful contrast between the flaky, old, dried look to the meaty older hand, and the smooth, almost transparent waxy look to the baby hand. (apologies if it is your hand, no offense!) I have never seen such a telling contrast - usually it is a mother''s lovely smooth hand, and the baby''s whole hand wrapped round one finger - this jolts me somehow - I feel my age more when I see this - it is so like my hand!', '2008-07-09 19:22:00.000000', NULL, 0),
