(6985364, 666321, 16148, '<td valign="top">Making a comment bombing run and decided to start with your lowest scoring image.  Hard to score much lower than this... look at all those 1''s.  Then again, it''s rare to get 63 comments and 9 favorites with a blue ribbon shot.  Could even be higher by the time you read this.  Just goes to show that score has little to do with success is art.  Thanks for making me smile with this intelligent challenge interpretation.</td>', 'Making a comment bombing run and decided to start with your lowest scoring image.  Hard to score much lower than this... look at all those 1''s.  Then again, it''s rare to get 63 comments and 9 favorites with a blue ribbon shot.  Could even be higher by the time you read this.  Just goes to show that score has little to do with success is art.  Thanks for making me smile with this intelligent challenge interpretation.', '2013-02-24 18:13:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(7071079, 664874, 3936, '<td valign="top">I can''t get my hands to do this, so they can''t be that old.  But graceful they are.</td>', 'I can''t get my hands to do this, so they can''t be that old.  But graceful they are.', '2013-07-15 23:30:18.000000', NULL, 0),
