(7567990, 666483, 47470, '<td valign="top">It''s been 10 years since you posted this, and I still think about it every time I see and oil stain on the ground.  Great shot!</td>', 'It''s been 10 years since you posted this, and I still think about it every time I see and oil stain on the ground.  Great shot!', '2018-05-08 01:14:07.000000', NULL, 0);
